I picked twelve of the photos posted here this year for a small show.

## Details

- **When**: Saturday 5 December to Sunday 20 December
- **Where**: the ground-floor lounge at Zeus Software
- **Hours**: 11 am to 6 pm, closed on Mondays

> Each photo will hang next to a short note from the day it was taken.

